                <head>[Letter omitted.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paso de la Piedad</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-07-29"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 29, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>To Messrs. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Auza</hi> and V<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >iezca</hi>:</p>
                <p>The bearer, Don Ignacio Soto, can certify to the truth of this.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JULIAN QUIROGA.</signed></closer>
            </div>
